{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47004","headline":"君子行 · 齐己","name":"君子行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣人不生，麟龙何瑞？梧桐不高，凤凰何止？吾闻古之有君子，行藏以时，进退求己。\n荣必爲天下荣，耻必爲天下耻。\n苟进不如此，退不如此。\n亦何必用虚僞之文章，取荣名而自美。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}